  {
   "type": "product_header",
   "title": "»toolBalancer«",
   "text": "<p>采用尖端技术与人体工学设计的动平衡系统</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ch/%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A/%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC\">立即咨询</a></p>",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/6/csm_header_toolBalancer_ab04491c9e.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 1080,
    "h": 896
   },
   "ftype": "zoller_product_header",
   "id": "c1086",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> 我们致力于智能进步 </h2>",
   "body": "<p>通过采用经过优化且高精度动平衡处理的刀具，可以延长刀具使用寿命、提高主轴运行时间，并提升工件的表面质量。借助»toolBalancer«，您不仅能让刀具，更能让整个生产过程在可持续性、效率和进步之间达到完美的平衡。</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ch/%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A/%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC\"><strong>立即咨询</strong></a></p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "text",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c1085",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "extra-large",
    "after": "extra-large"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "quotes",
   "header": "",
   "slides": [
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/f/csm_toolBalancer_Frank_Hartstein2_123681c0f9.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">功能与人体工学设计的独特平衡，确保精准的测量结果：这正是为您的生产带来的高精度与经认证的安全保障。</p> <p><strong>Frank Hartstein，»toolBalancer«产品开发团队成员</strong></p>",
     "right": false,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/7/csm_toolBalancer_Christoph_Zoller2_490ea1f2a5.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">作为科技企业，ZOLLER聚焦我们的经验与专业能力，用于这款新产品的研发，由此树立了又一里程碑，并完善了ZOLLER的产品组合。这正是ZOLLER一贯的风格：一站式服务。</p> <p><strong>Christoph Zoller，总经理</strong></p>",
     "right": false,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/5/csm_toolBalancer_Alexander_Zoller2_7bc76f629f.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">设计、人体工学与智能技术的完美结合。ZOLLER 解决方案通过安全认证，助力您的生产过程实现资源节约型应用。</p> <p><strong>亚历山大·佐勒，总经理</strong></p>",
     "right": true,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    }
   ],
